
---
---
<section id="inicio" 
         class="relative min-h-screen pt-24 flex items-center justify-center 
                bg-linnear-to-b from-gray-100 to-white 
                dark:from-gray-950 dark:to-gray-900 
                transition-colors duration-300 overflow-hidden">
    
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/public/img/XSS2-fondo.png')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-93    dark:opacity-95 pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 text-center z-10 flex flex-col items-center">
        
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase
                     bg-green-100 text-green-800 dark:bg-green-900/30 dark:text-green-400 mb-6">
            Servicio Técnico Especializado en Xbox
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-red-500 dark:text-white mb-6">
            Bienvenido a <span class="text-green-600 dark:text-green-400 drop-shadow-sm">Zombie Mitosis</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="hidden md:block text-lg sm:text-xl rounded-full bg-mist-400 text-green-900
                 dark:bg-mist-500 text-white max-w-2xl font-medium leading-relaxed mb-10">
            Reparación que se reproduce. Soluciones definitivas en mantenimiento preventivo, fallas de hardware y software para que tu consola vuelva a la vida.
        </p>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 w-full sm:w-auto justify-center">
            <a href="#contacto" 
               class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-white 
                      bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 active:scale-[0.98] 
                      rounded-xl shadow-lg shadow-green-600/20 dark:shadow-none 
                      transition-all duration-200">
                Cotizar Mantenimiento
            </a>
        </div>

    </div>

    <div class="absolute -top-40 -right-40 w-96 h-96 bg-green-400/10 dark:bg-green-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-40 -left-40 w-96 h-96 bg-green-400/10 dark:bg-green-500/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

</section>